(text "24 V arrives from the panel XT90 and 7 A breaker on J1. The plug-in power module (PM1) carries the TPS2663 eFuse and the TPS7A4901." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid df423dfd-76ca-4302-acee-9dcf6b70da63))
(text "PM1 returns protected +24V, and makes +5VA (analog 5 V) from +12V. Its eFuse fault and current-monitor outputs go to the expander and ADC #2." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ff3fc608-0b11-4e9f-b804-8a646436b159))
(text "Pololu D24V22Fx pin order is NOT verified: check it against the module before drawing the footprint." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f79b1d5c-248e-4d0f-b8c5-b36d611c9fdf))
(text "LM1117: tantalum (or ESR-specified) 10 uF on input and output, per the TI datasheet." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a4eb9ce3-7359-465d-9e90-03b4c0c0c9ca))
(text "+24V_FIELD feeds limit switches, the orifice selector and the E-stop status contact, through a 0.1 A PTC." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 86912e32-0aac-450c-8081-5181c26845ef))
